        "original_id": "b7ed376d-f625-56aa-8c76-ce14f8bc5bc5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: When I Was Born for the 7th Time, \"Brimful of Asha\"\n- People: Cornershop\n- Companies: Wiiija\n- Topics: album releases, music criticism, chart performance\n\nFacts:\n- On 8 September 1997, Cornershop released the third studio album When I Was Born for the 7th Time through Wiiija.\n- In 1997, Cornershop released the single \"Brimful of Asha\".\n- In 1997, \"Brimful of Asha\" originally reached number 60 on the UK Singles Chart.\n- When I Was Born for the 7th Time received high acclaim from music critics.\n- When I Was Born for the 7th Time features the international hit single \"Brimful of Asha\".",
